    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Database pool: connections in use and pool size",
      "description": "Connections in use by the backend against the size the pool keeps (the pool can create a few more for a moment). Several backend processes: counters and rates are summed across them; database-state gauges (rides, offers, pool) are the same in every process, so they use max, not sum.",
      "datasource": {
