    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Seconds since the sweeper last succeeded",
      "description": "Should stay below about 5. A line that keeps rising means the sweeper has stopped or keeps failing. Several backend processes: counters and rates are summed across them; database-state gauges (rides, offers, pool) are the same in every process, so they use max, not sum.",
